<title>UK: Cobham races ahead after bumper results.</title>
<headline>Cobham races ahead after bumper results.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in aeronautical components and systems supplier Cobham Plc soared 25p to 642-1/2p after 1996 results showed strong profits growth, market makers said.</p>
<p>&quot;The figures were just above what we were expecting plus the fact that the market was up this morning and Cobham is a first class company,&quot; said one.</p>
<p>Pre-tax profit was up 47 percent to 43.7 million stg.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4026</p>
